 When I&rsquo;m not designing, I&rsquo;ve appreciated finding new ways to express myself through unique mediums. Telling stories through videography, animation, writing, music production, or augmented reality feels like digital magic.
&ldquo;To create is to be human; and to be human is to feel and interact with the world around us.&rdquo;
